This project is a port of the game logic of Stranded II by Peter Schauß /
Unreal Software (https://www.unrealsoftware.de). The original Blitz3D source
code of Stranded II was published under the Creative Commons
Attribution-NonCommercial-ShareAlike 3.0 Germany license, and this derived
code is released under the same license:

  CC BY-NC-SA 3.0 DE
  https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc-sa/3.0/de/deed.en

You may copy, modify and redistribute this code for non-commercial purposes
as long as you keep this notice, credit Stranded II and Unreal Software, link
https://www.unrealsoftware.de, and release derived works under the same
license. Commercial use requires permission from Peter Schauß / Unreal
Software.

The game assets of Stranded II (models, textures, sounds, music, maps and
definition files) are not part of this repository. They remain the property
of Peter Schauß / Unreal Software and are downloaded from the official site
at build time solely to run this non-commercial remake.
